# Forwards the old address to the new one and keeps the page path,
# so kearneyinsider.com/deals lands on platterivermarketing.com/deals.
#
# IMPORTANT: platterivermarketing.com must already be added to this
# Netlify project (Domain management) before this file is deployed.
# Keep kearneyinsider.com on the project as a domain alias.

http://kearneyinsider.com/*       https://platterivermarketing.com/:splat  301!
https://kearneyinsider.com/*      https://platterivermarketing.com/:splat  301!
http://www.kearneyinsider.com/*   https://platterivermarketing.com/:splat  301!
https://www.kearneyinsider.com/*  https://platterivermarketing.com/:splat  301!
